# Issue #3238 (segmented rotation baselines, PR 2; greenfield flag day, no
# compatibility shim): a rotation baseline is an ordered group of update
# records, its segments, in place of one snapshot record. An update's signed
# metadata drops `checkpointKind`, `checkpointPayloadKind` and
# `sourceVersionVector` for `baselineId`, `baselineSegmentIndex`,
# `baselineSegmentCount`, `baselineSegmentsDigest` and `coversThroughUpdateId`,
# so every request that embeds a document sync update loses the three
# properties. No build reads them, and the SDK ships with the API. Remove
# these entries, and this file, as soon as main contains this contract.
POST /auth/register removed the request property `initialOrganizationMetadataContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointKind` (shared schema: `DocumentCreateSeedRequest`, also at `initialRosterProfileContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointKind`, `initialSystemContainers/items/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointKind` and 3 more)
POST /auth/register removed the request property `initialOrganizationMetadataContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointPayloadKind` (shared schema: `DocumentCreateSeedRequest`, also at `initialRosterProfileContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointPayloadKind`, `initialSystemContainers/items/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointPayloadKind` and 3 more)
POST /auth/register removed the request property `initialOrganizationMetadataContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/sourceVersionVector` (shared schema: `DocumentCreateSeedRequest`, also at `initialRosterProfileContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/sourceVersionVector`, `initialSystemContainers/items/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/sourceVersionVector` and 3 more)
POST /blobs/{blobId}/attachment-bindings removed the request property `documentSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointKind`
POST /blobs/{blobId}/attachment-bindings removed the request property `documentSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointPayloadKind`
POST /blobs/{blobId}/attachment-bindings removed the request property `documentSync/outgoingUpdates/items/sourceVersionVector`
POST /containers/with-metadata-document removed the request property `initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointKind`
POST /containers/with-metadata-document removed the request property `initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointPayloadKind`
POST /containers/with-metadata-document removed the request property `initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/sourceVersionVector`
POST /documents removed the request property `initialSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointKind`
POST /documents removed the request property `initialSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointPayloadKind`
POST /documents removed the request property `initialSync/outgoingUpdates/items/sourceVersionVector`
POST /documents/{documentId}/sync removed the request property `outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointKind`
POST /documents/{documentId}/sync removed the request property `outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointPayloadKind`
POST /documents/{documentId}/sync removed the request property `outgoingUpdates/items/sourceVersionVector`
POST /organizations removed the request property `initialOrganizationMetadataContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointKind` (shared schema: `DocumentCreateSeedRequest`, also at `initialRosterProfileContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointKind`, `initialSystemContainers/items/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointKind` and 3 more)
POST /organizations removed the request property `initialOrganizationMetadataContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointPayloadKind` (shared schema: `DocumentCreateSeedRequest`, also at `initialRosterProfileContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointPayloadKind`, `initialSystemContainers/items/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/checkpointPayloadKind` and 3 more)
POST /organizations removed the request property `initialOrganizationMetadataContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/sourceVersionVector` (shared schema: `DocumentCreateSeedRequest`, also at `initialRosterProfileContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/sourceVersionVector`, `initialSystemContainers/items/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/sourceVersionVector` and 3 more)

# Issue #3238 PR 2: a link-set mutation's `rotationBaseline` is the group's
# segments, an array of 1 to 64 updates, where it was one update. Remove these
# entries as soon as main contains this contract.
POST /documents/{documentId}/link the `rotationBaseline` request property `type` changed from `object` to `array<object>`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link the `rotationBaseline` request property's maxItems was set to `64`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link the `rotationBaseline` request property's minItems was set to `1`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink the `rotationBaseline` request property `type` changed from `object` to `array<object>`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink the `rotationBaseline` request property's maxItems was set to `64`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink the `rotationBaseline` request property's minItems was set to `1`

# Issue #3238 PR 2: the same change read from the old shape: an unlink's
# `rotationBaseline` was an object, so each of its properties reads as removed
# now that it is an array of the same update. Remove these entries as soon as
# main contains this contract.
POST /documents/{documentId}/link removed the request property `rotationBaseline/checkpointKind`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link removed the request property `rotationBaseline/checkpointPayloadKind`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link removed the request property `rotationBaseline/coversThroughUpdateId`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link removed the request property `rotationBaseline/dependencyVersionVector`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link removed the request property `rotationBaseline/encryptedData`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link removed the request property `rotationBaseline/id`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link removed the request property `rotationBaseline/partialEndVersionVector`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link removed the request property `rotationBaseline/partialStartVersionVector`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link removed the request property `rotationBaseline/plaintextHash`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link removed the request property `rotationBaseline/sourceVersionVector`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link removed the request property `rotationBaseline/writeHeader`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink removed the request property `rotationBaseline/checkpointKind`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink removed the request property `rotationBaseline/checkpointPayloadKind`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink removed the request property `rotationBaseline/coversThroughUpdateId`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink removed the request property `rotationBaseline/dependencyVersionVector`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink removed the request property `rotationBaseline/encryptedData`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink removed the request property `rotationBaseline/id`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink removed the request property `rotationBaseline/partialEndVersionVector`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink removed the request property `rotationBaseline/partialStartVersionVector`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink removed the request property `rotationBaseline/plaintextHash`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink removed the request property `rotationBaseline/sourceVersionVector`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink removed the request property `rotationBaseline/writeHeader`

# Issue #3238 PR 2: a rotation baseline that is not one whole group is refused
# with the new code `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid`, which joins the
# document sync error codes every document and container mutation may report.
# Only a request that carries a baseline can receive it, and only the new
# client builds one. Remove these entries as soon as main contains this
# contract.
DELETE /containers/{containerId} added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code/anyOf[#/components/schemas/DocumentMutationErrorCode]/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
GET /documents/{documentId}/purge added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `404`
GET /documents/{documentId}/purge added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /containers added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code/anyOf[#/components/schemas/DocumentMutationErrorCode]/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /containers/with-metadata-document added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code/anyOf[#/components/schemas/DocumentMutationErrorCode]/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /containers/{containerId}/move added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code/anyOf[#/components/schemas/DocumentMutationErrorCode]/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /containers/{containerId}/recite added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code/anyOf[#/components/schemas/DocumentMutationErrorCode]/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /containers/{containerId}/rekey added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code/anyOf[#/components/schemas/DocumentMutationErrorCode]/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /containers/{containerId}/revoke added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code/anyOf[#/components/schemas/DocumentMutationErrorCode]/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /containers/{containerId}/share added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code/anyOf[#/components/schemas/DocumentMutationErrorCode]/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /documents added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `404`
POST /documents added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `404`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /documents/{documentId}/purge added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `404`
POST /documents/{documentId}/purge added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /documents/{documentId}/sync added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `code` response property for the response status `409`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `404`
POST /documents/{documentId}/unlink added the new `document_sync_baseline_group_invalid` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
